  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "It is example of carbylamine reaction. so, the product will be $\\mathrm{C}_2 \\mathrm{H}_5 \\mathrm{NC}$ and $\\mathrm{KCl}$. \nHence, (D) is the correct answer.",
